WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
There are 2 DLCs arriving for Dark Souls 3

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:09.340
and there are two, very intruguing, unfinished plot lines that still remain in the game

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.880
and this two plot lines, they directly oppose one another.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:20.220
One, in the previous video, was a tale of Londor and this is a tale of the Angels.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.520
That was a story of a Dark Wraith locked in the deepest depths

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.740
and this is a story of an Angel locked in a cell in the tallest tower.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.740
A story about usurping the fire and a story about linking it.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:39.320
A story of Kaathe and Frampt, of gods and men.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:45.900
Miyazaki, the game's creator, he takes a lot of inspiration from the manga series Berserk

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:51.080
and one of the most powerful themes in Berserk that I don't see a lot of people talking about is

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.820
The displacement of good and evil in themes of dark and light.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.560
For example, good is seen in the Black Swordsman

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.800
and his darkness.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.700
And evil is seen in the angels

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.820
and their light.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.060
Similarly, in Souls

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.680
mankind were the ones with the Dark Souls

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.140
even tho the gods were associated with fire and light

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:17.780
These gods are dedicated to selfishly keeping themselves in power,

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.380
at the expense of all humanity.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.420
So, keep this in mind, as we talk about the Angels of Dark Souls 3 because

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.780
I wouldn't be surprised if Gwynevere were a boss in the DLC,

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.280
but we'll get to that.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:35.540
The Angelic Faith has its roots in Lothric were queen Gwynevere is said

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:38.160
to have raised several heavenly children.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:42.180
The Lothric bloodline has always been devoted to the linking of the fire

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.140
Obsessed with creating a worthy heir

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:49.600
and their ruler, currently, appears to be the young prince Lothric and

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.840
ingraved upon the doors leading to his chambers

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:56.520
are three figures that rapresent the three pillars of power

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.520
that uphold his rule

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:04.440
First, the high Priestess, whos duty it is to feed and care for the noble children,

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.440
essentialy she is their wet nurse

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:10.280
and it's clear that these women grown the princes for a role

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.140
in the linking of the fire.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.360
They're not your traditional wet nurse

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.800
For, one of them begs us to convince Lothric to follow his duty as a lord,

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:24.840
and the other two sit directly within the Firelink Shrines.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.700
The second pillar is the Knight responsible for the defense of the kingdom.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:35.420
The Lothric knights were allowed to tend to the Wyverns and fight alongside them

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.740
As these dragons also belong as a symbol of Lothric.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.020
And the third pillar, the scholar,

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.980
who is master of the Grand Archives of Knowledge.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.640
And of the three, the scholar seems the most influential,

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.760
Especially to our young lord Lothric

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:55.540
who was frail and disinclined to knighthood

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.780
The Grand Archives and the Lothric bloodline

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.780
They also rose together

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.340
and the first of the scholars

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:07.680
Was allegged to be a private mentor to the royal prince.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.020
And here is were the story gets really fascinating because

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.020
this private mentor, the first of the scholars

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.480
he doubted the linking of the fire.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:21.060
and it's clear that whoever he is

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:25.460
he planted thought of rebellion into the young lords mind.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.920
So, this were the three accepted of the king's rule.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:33.100
the High Priestess, the Knight and the Scholar

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.260
But there was on more pillar, who served Lothric on the fringes

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.700
and in the shadows:

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.620
The Hunters,

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.620
the forth pillar of rule.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:46.260
Who punished the king's enemies in ways the king's three pillar cannot

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.380
This were highly adept warriors

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.560
and they were known for wielding paired weapons.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.100
And some were so proficient in their duty

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:58.580
that they even managed to serve successive generations of kings.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:04.020
These hunters specifically became known has the "King'd black hand"

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:07.980
And for generations these hunters served the Lothric bloodline and

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.760
for generations their rule was clearly prosperous.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.700
However, the pillars of Lothric are crumbling when we arrive;

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.960
And Prince Lothric refuses to link the fire.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:21.380
So bare with me once I have the groundwork laid we can get

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.380
to the really interesting angel's stuff

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.780
So, in Dark Souls one, we were introduced to Gwynevere,

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:30.760
who is firstborn daughter of Gwynn, the man who linked the fire

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.560
And this illusion of Gwynevere, at least,

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.760
Says this:

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.080
Please,

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:38.740
Father's rule thou should assume

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.380
And inheriteth the Fire of our world

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:47.940
In Lothric, now, Gwynevere is heavily implied to be the Queen of Lothric

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.800
Married to king Oceiros

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.760
And revered as a goddess of fertility and bounty

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.700
And living up to that title, she became a wife and a mother

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.240
Who raised several angelic children

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:04.320
And just like in Dark Souls 1, she's pushing Undead

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:08.200
to link the fire. She's one of those goddesses that uses us.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:10.880
And the Lothric bloodline, her children,

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.920
They were obsessed with creating a worthy heir.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:19.680
And there is a lot more evidence of her influence in pushing Undead and Unkindled to link the fire.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.360
The path to the Kiln itself is hidden

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.360
behind the queen's castle

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.720
And unkindled are even born

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.840
with a Circlet of the Way of White

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.680
which is a symbol very closely associated with Gwynevere.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:37.040
The queen even placed a powerful artefact in a coffin

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:41.080
That she thought a future unkindled could profit from

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:44.260
And yet, the castle is in chaos,

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:46.260
her husband has gone mad, and

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:49.980
her noble children are scattered and defiant.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.340
So the queen does what she did in Dark Souls 1:

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.660
she leaves the kingdom.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.400
And we, when we go through it we're

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.220
left to piece together

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.580
how exactly this kingdom collapsed

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.020
from the children,

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.160
her children, that remain.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.900
Prince Lorian and his younger brother, Lothric

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.480
remain in the throne room of their castle.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:15.880
Implying that they were the ones in power as their rule collapsed

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:21.180
Prince Lothric is described as the last hope of his line for linking the fire

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:25.880
But Lothric went against his duty and against Gwynevere's legacy,

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.040
and refused to link the fire.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:33.400
When you approach their chambers, take notice of this stretch leading up to it.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.280
All the knights are facing outwards, barricades are raised,

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:41.820
and sure this could mean that they're protecting him from us, the Unkindled, but

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:47.760
I think that they could also be protecting Lothric from the Angels and their winged knights.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.720
So this is my favorite part of the script.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:55.840
At the tallest point of the Grand Archives hangs this enormous cage.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:01.920
Within is a corpse, white feathers, and the miracle Divine Pillars of Light,

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:07.340
which was a miracle of Gertrude, named the heavenly daughter, and in Japanese,

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.140
the Angel's daughter.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:12.820
Gertrude is said by many to be the queen's child.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:17.260
This miracle brings down divine pillars of light, and

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:21.080
it was told to Gertrude when she was visited by an angel.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:25.960
Despite losing her sight and her voice, you know she was blind and mute,

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:31.380
Gertrude was still determined to record this tale of the angel's visit.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:38.900
Somehow, this blind, mute girl wrote down what she heard in a fragmentary scroll.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:45.360
And in Dark souls 3 there's this huge tradition of placing great faith in the words of the blind.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:50.060
So somehow despite being impossible for ordinary men to decipher,

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:55.460
this tale of the angel became the foundation of the angelic faith of Lothric.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:08:00.930
So now a question is: what does the
angelic faith of Lothric stand for?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:05.639
What do they represent ? And it's my
belief that all angelic references are

00:08:05.639 --> 00:08:10.680
related to the Way of White, which was a
human faith of clerics, paladins and

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:15.760
pilgrims who are supporters of the
linking of the fire and the gods.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:20.960
Let me provide some evidence. As he traveled through the world of Dark Souls 3,

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:24.540
the sharp observer would have realized that there are a lot of angelic references

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:30.400
and i'll name five and convince you of
their relationship to the kingdom of Lothric.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:39.260
So, one: the statues in upper Lothric are winged and one set of wings even belongs to a depiction of a primordial serpent

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:42.780
In the last episode we talked about the mention of Kaath

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:47.880
and on the flip side wouldn't it be
fitting for Frampt, who is this serpent

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:52.170
in Dark Souls 1 who was a huge
advocate for the linking of the fire,

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:56.500
wouldn't it make sense for him to be a
manipulating force in Lothric ?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.220
A rule known for the linking of the fire ?

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:06.240
Secondly, in the cathedral of the deep
you see statues of winged men, and indeed

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:13.020
the archdeacon's of the deep wear robes
denoting the highest rank in the Way of White.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.780
And originally this order was not evil:

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:20.640
they were devoted to tending to the
flame and in this video we assumed that

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:25.460
this meant that they were tending to the
flame of Aldrich, when he became a Lord of Cinder.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:30.870
However when Aldrich rose from the dead, this order of the Way of White became

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:36.240
corrupted by his influence and they abandoned their service to the gods.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.840
You see this in the statues, the Angels.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:43.400
This Way of White cleric it's
overcome by Aldrich's filth.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:47.400
Third: the Silver Knight helms are winged

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:52.440
and indeed the Silver Knights in particular are loyal to the old royal family

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.660
even protecting this family's Manor long after it was abandoned.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.040
In particular though, the Silver Knight Shield has the

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:04.160
blessing of their goddess Gwynevere upon it, even to this day.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:09.860
And Gwynevere is intrinsically related to the Angels: four of her children,

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:16.370
Gertrude, Lothric, Lorian and Rosaria, they
have some link to white feathers.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:24.420
On Gertrude's cage floor, Lothric's floor and shot from the bident of the man grub casters

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.800
And Gertrude's description
actually calls her the Angels daughter

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:30.660
in Japanese not just a heavenly daughter.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:36.000
These children are linked to Gwynevere and they're linked to the angels and

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.620
finally, when I look at these beheaded
statues in lower Lothric, I think of

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.389
another reference to beheading.

00:10:42.389 --> 00:10:47.880
You know we place the heads of the Lords of cinder, their cinders, atop their thrones

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:52.460
to satiate the fire linking ritual. And I think these statues are a

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:55.949
symbol of self-sacrifice to the linking
of the fire.

00:10:55.949 --> 00:11:02.340
Look at the way they cut their own throats and hold their own heads willingly in their hands.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.520
When these were built Lothric was known for the linking of the fire, and

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.100
I think these represent that.

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:14.840
And the final reference to beheading to the Way of White are the winged executioners,

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.640
who swore themselves to the angels.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:23.100
And their set reveals the most curious part of this story.

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:28.889
It says that worship of these divine messengers is heresy in Lothric and

00:11:28.889 --> 00:11:32.360
unrecognized by any of the three pillars of rule.

00:11:32.369 --> 00:11:40.440
In an attic in the castle, behind an illusionary wall, lies a giant portrait of a winged messenger

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:48.200
and a sacred shield. A shield known as Sorcerer's Bane bein and an heirloom of the Way of White.

00:11:48.209 --> 00:11:53.579
Now with all the connections we just
made to the Angels being supportive of

00:11:53.579 --> 00:11:54.959
the linking of the fire:

00:11:54.959 --> 00:11:59.419
the statues, the helmets, the feathers, why would Lauthric call it heresy?

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.760
Why build statues to something heretical?

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:08.040
And the only solution I can come up with is that it became heresy

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.020
when Lothric refused to link the fire.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:15.600
It is said that this is why Gertrude, the heavenly daughter was imprisoned

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.900
in the lofty cell of the Grand archives.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:23.070
Her faith, previously accepted, must have become heresy

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:28.020
when Prince Lothric took over, for he was
positioned directly against it.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:33.870
And remember the First of the Scholars was private mentor to Prince Lothric and

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:37.990
of the three pillars the Scholars are
closest to the Prince.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:42.830
And it is the Scholars themselves who tampered with the sacred chime of Gertrude,

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.800
allowing her blessed item to be used for their own ends.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:52.290
And in a huge way the scholars were
behind Lothric's refusal to link the fire

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.240
and in turn

00:12:54.240 --> 00:13:00.540
Lothric's prosecution of the angels. It's no wonder that Gwynevere fled the kingdom.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:05.240
And one of the earliest Lore questions I
ever had in Dark Souls 3,

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:10.100
you might remember it, was why I an
executioner was patrolling a burning

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.220
courtyard full of headless knights.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:18.220
Why this was the scene of the battle ? 
And now i think i know why.

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:22.440
I think Gertrude's imprisonment was the
beginning of a conflict

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:25.180
between the crown and the angels.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:30.410
Lothric knights and winged knights never
fight together and both lower and upper

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:34.700
Lothric have corpses from each side
within the castle itself.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.170
Additionally the assassins close to the
crown prince,

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:44.779
the black hand, one of their rings is on
the roof where three fully ascended

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:49.000
golden winged knights guard the
entrance to Gertrude's cell.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:54.220
The kings' black hand assassin, loyal to Prince Lothric,
was here and he was killed

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:58.680
So now we come to the part where the
answer is very much up to you:

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:00.940
Is Gertrude the corpse in the cell?

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:05.850
Perhaps killed by the king's black hand,
or simply dead of starvation?

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:12.080
Or is Gertrude's cell door open because she
escaped, flown away by one of the winged knights?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.180
Or is Gertrude alive and in-game?

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:22.700
Issue related to this man-grub bizarrely placed on the rafters below her cell.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:27.630
Is Gertrude Rosaria? If i'm not mistaken the first one to come up with this theory was

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:31.750
reddit user deleted_away, who in particular

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.940
reminded me of the
Deacons relationship to the Way of White,

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:39.900
of Saint Klimt, and also of the darkwraith
far below and the angel up above.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.230
I'm hugely thankful that he reminded me
of these connections because it's become

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.120
a really important part of the story.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:49.440
So why is this man-grub here? Is Gertrude Rosaria?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:55.040
The man-grubs are creatures that have
been reborn through Rosaria, Mother of Rebirth,

00:14:55.040 --> 00:15:00.440
located in the Cathedral of the
Deep, and worshipped by some as a goddess.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:03.870
Rosaria's fingers collect tongues in
her name

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:08.130
Some do it to be reborn. Indeed if you
hand in more than five,

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.610
you're said to run the risk of turning into
a man-grub.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:16.560
But some simply give her tongues to help
comfort their voiceless goddess for

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:21.500
Rosaria, Mother of Rebirth, was robbed of
her tongue by her firstborn,

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:24.420
and has been waiting for their return ever since.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.180
We talked earlier about how
the Archdeacon's of the Deep

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:32.700
are high-ranking within the Way of White and
we've established the Way of White are

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:36.360
devoted to the servitude of the gods and
their Age of Fire.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:40.200
So it makes sense that the Cathedral of
the Deep would have been a safe place

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.660
for Gertrude to escape to.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:47.520
Or, at least, why a daughter of Gwynevere
could reside in this place.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:51.860
Even if you don't believe that Gertrude is 
Rosaria, and I do have my doubts,

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:56.430
it's incredibly likely that Rosaria is a
daughter of Gwynevere, given the feathers

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.960
and given the fact that she has one of
Gwynevere's miracles as a part of her soul.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.900
So you don't have to believe that
Gertrude is Rosaria,

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.140
but Rosaria is here for a reason.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.900
And as we know the Deacons of the Deep
became completely corrupted by

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:15.220
Alrdich's influence. In fact all three
archdeacon's are characterized by an

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.120
abandonment of their duty in the Way of
White.

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:23.000
One in particular, though. He was
originally tasked with attending to

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.460
Rosaria, Mother of Rebirth.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:29.960
His name was Saint Klimt and we hear
about him from his weapon,

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.660
the Saint's Bident, which he eventually
discarded.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:37.820
This bident was a holy symbol, which draws upon faith.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:42.020
You see this Bident actually when man-grub casters attack you.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:46.820
This exact shape materializes leaving
behind a trail of white feathers.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.810
Assumedly this is a symbol of Klimt's
relationship with Rosaria through the

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:55.250
Bident and Rosaria's connection to the
Way of White through the feathers.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:59.600
Or, by now, if you believe this theory about her being Gertrude,

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.800
maybe I should be calling Rosaria Gertrude.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:06.740
However, like the other deacons abandoning
their duty to the linking of the fire,

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:10.640
Klimt discarded this weapon and put his
faith behind him.

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:15.650
So if you believe the theory that
Gertrude was Rosaria, then she was

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:19.450
forced out of Lothric because the
angelic faith was lost there, and

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:24.680
after taking the name Rosaria in her new refuge,
the Cathedral of the Deep

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:28.880
she was trapped there too, once the
Deacons became corrupted by the Deep.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:33.980
So, again, the Way of White and the Angels
would have been cast out of Lothric

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:38.500
essentially, so there might still have
been refuge in the Cathedral of the Deep

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:42.140
where the Deacons still served the
Way of White. So that makes sense for

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:48.140
Rosaria or Gertrude to be placed there.
But after they turned to Aldrich

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:52.970
Rosaria would be in trouble and you sort
of see that when you look outside her

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:58.040
chambers: there are man-grubs infesting the
cathedral and they're defending her.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:02.540
They're staked to the walls maybe in
defense of their goddess and there are

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:07.790
bars that are bent outwards and a
lot of sludge around the area so... Maybe

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:10.850
Aldrich tried to get in there when he
was on his way out

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:16.400
So this entire part about Gertrude being
Rosaria, it's a fantastic theory and one of

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.820
the best in the series because of all
the little circumstantial pieces of

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:20.630
evidence.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:24.530
Even if I'm not totally convinced and it
isn't perfect.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:30.090
It doesn't explain the corpse in the
cage, or why Rosaria, supposedly an angel,

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.260
instructs her followers to invade and pillage.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.240
On the other hand, Gertrude

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:40.700
taught her followers Bountiful Light and
Rosaria's soul teaches us Bountiful

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:44.390
Sunlight, a more powerful version of the
same spell.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.080
If we get more information in the DLC,
which I think we will,

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.200
we'll come back to this topic. But for
now the only thing that matters is:

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.380
What do you think?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:58.760
It's been a while since the way of white
surfaced in such a powerful way.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:03.180
In Dark Souls 1, they sent an undead
paladin to fetch the Rite of Kindling,

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.140
deep within the Catacombs and

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:10.180
it was the start of a convenient way of
disposing of undead within their ranks

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:15.020
and they continued to send their undead
to Lordran on this quest,

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:20.360
Convincing them it was a holy pilgrimage,
you know, if they succeed, if they bought back the

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:25.520
Rite of Kindling, then, great! But if they
failed then the Way of White just

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:27.540
disposed of some undead.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:31.580
And in Dark Souls 3 the Way of White
continues to use humans

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:36.200
for kindling and assuming the Way of
White are the Angels, they're presented

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:42.350
as angelic, as good, as Holy, but the
reality is that them, and Gwynevere

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:47.570
likely at their head, are anything but.
They've been using humanity for kindling

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:52.760
and I think we'll be getting the chance
for a little bit of revenge soon.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:58.760
The day before I finished this script, user
