00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.140
Have a listen

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:30.179
I'd say they're onto something here and
even if it's not Gwynevere it could

00:20:30.179 --> 00:20:34.409
be someone related to her so with
Gamescom coming up,

00:20:34.409 --> 00:20:39.210
I expect we'll be hearing about DLC soon
but what will it be? About the hollows of

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:44.250
Landor? The angels of Lothric? Or will i be
pleasantly surprised, and it will be

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.990
something else entirely?

